   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Dr. Tam Nguyen",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 6,
   "text": "A Smile's Best Start",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. Nguyen, a proud Houston native and a board-certified pediatric dentist, is passionate about cultivating healthy oral habits from a young age. A graduate of Boston University, she specializes in pediatric dental care, providing a fun, gentle, and nurturing environment for children and parents alike. Emphasizing preventative dentistry, Dr. Nguyen and her team are committed to guiding families on a journey to lifelong dental health.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. Nguyen, a proud Houston native and a board-certified pediatric dentist, is passionate about cultivating healthy oral habits from a young age. A graduate of Boston University, she specializes in pediatric dental care, providing a fun, gentle, and nurturing environment for children and parents alike. Emphasizing preventative dentistry, Dr. Nguyen and her team are committed to guiding families on a journey to lifelong dental health.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Dr. Dave Cho",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 6,
   "text": "Building Relationships, One Smile at a Time",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. Cho’s journey from biochemistry to dentistry underscores his dedication to oral health and patient care. His extensive skills in oral surgery, endodontics, and cosmetic dentistry, complemented by a laid-back approach, ensure a relaxing experience for patients across Katy, TX. His commitment to continued education keeps him at the forefront of advanced technology in dental care, from Invisalign to sedation dentistry.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. Cho’s journey from biochemistry to dentistry underscores his dedication to oral health and patient care. His extensive skills in oral surgery, endodontics, and cosmetic dentistry, complemented by a laid-back approach, ensure a relaxing experience for patients across Katy, TX. His commitment to continued education keeps him at the forefront of advanced technology in dental care, from Invisalign to sedation dentistry.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
